 inches? Megan Fox is one of the actresses with these height measurements. She is an American actress who made her acting debut in the family film Holiday in the Sun.\\n\\nMegan Fox is known for her vampy and stylish looks ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.tuko.co.ke/facts-lifehacks/celebrity-biographies/512328-famous-celebrities-54-inspire-dressing/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... Directed by Tony Award® nominee Jessica Stone (Kimberly Akimbo), with a book by three-time Tony nominee Rick Elice (Peter and the Starcatcher, Jersey Boys) adapted from Sara Gruen's novel, and a soaring score by the acclaimed PigPen Theatre Co., WATER FOR ELEPHANTS unites innovative stagecraft with ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.manhattantheatreclub.com/past-productions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... She went on to marry actor Mark Harmon, who is also featured below!\\n\\nMORE PAM: Pam Dawber: From alien sidekick to the sexiest man alive's better half (1970s-1980s)\\n\\nYoung Pam Dawber for Corn Silk makeup (1973)\\n\\nActress Pam Dawber for Sealy mattresses (1976)\\n\\nYoung actress Rene ... \",\"title\":\"https://clickamericana.com/topics/celebrities-famous-people/model-to-actor-before-they-were-famous\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... Chase's final storm-out was the last straw for Harmon, who booted Chase from future seasons.\\n\\nTo make things even more interesting, at the next day's cast and crew wrap party, Harmon gave a speech about the incident to everyone assembled. In his remarks, Harmon allegedly ... \"