dren. His first marriage was to Dodie Levy-Fraser in 1956, and they had two children: Mark and Josh. They divorced in 1962. Landon then married Marjorie Lynn ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/little-house-on-the-prairie-cast-where-are-they-now-8603014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d12\"},\"ref\":\"d12\",\"snippet\":\" ... A drama teacher and vocal coach in later years, Harris died of a blood clot to the heart on November 3, 2002, just three days before his 88th birthday. He was survived by his long-time wife (from 1938), Gertrude Bregman, and son Richard (born 1942). He was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2002\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... Married and divorced three times, Arlene had three children: Adam Palmer, Avra Douglas, and Jod Douglas.\\n\\nMartel died at age 78 of a heart attack on August 12, 2014 in Santa Monica, California. She had battled breast cancer some years earlier. - Actress\\n\\n- Writer\\n\\n- Additional Crew\\n\\nShirley Temple was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was married a total of seven times, and fathered eight children.\\n\\nAfter long battles with ill health, Richard Pryor passed away on December 10th, 2005.- Vincent Schiavelli, selected in 1997 by Vanity Fair as one of the best character actors in America, had made over 120 film ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2005&ref_=nmbio\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... died in California on June 29, 2023 at the age of 89. He is survived by his three sons - Adam, Matthew, and Anthony Dana Arkin, and with Dana, Alan Arkin is survived by third wife, Suzanne Newlander Arkin, whom he married in 1999.- Actor\\n\\n- Soundtrack\\n\\nPopular British character ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2023&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d71\"},\"ref\":\"d71\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is survived by his wife Kelly Rizzo and his three children.\\n\\nDwayne Hickman\\n\\nDwayne Hickman, the TV executive and actor best known for his role as girl-infatuated teen Dobie Gillis in the CBS sitcom The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis, died on Jan. 9 from complications ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/celebrity/stars-we-lost-in-2022/?srsltid=AfmBOoqgtseDJPvB8Bamfe3oZlhWJZaiC5kf4fxP0pjffkBximQEpPNy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d57\"},\"ref\":\"d57\",\"snippet\":\" ... Married and divorced three times, Arlene had three children: Adam Palmer, Avra Douglas, and Jod Douglas.\\n\\nMartel died at age 78 of a heart attack on August 12, 2014 in Santa Monica, California. She had battled breast cancer some years earlier. - Hailing from Long Beach, California, talented character ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1936&ref_=nmbio_bth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d77\"},\"ref\":\"d77\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is survived by his second wife, Tanya McCallin, from whom he was separated, as well as his three children, Conrad, Beatie, and Clemmie and three gran